---
import { steps } from "../data/site";
---

<section id="trabajo" class="relative py-[100px] z-2 bg-band-cta">
  <div class="wrap max-w-[1440px] mx-auto px-7 md:px-[88px] relative z-2">
    <div
      class="reveal flex flex-col items-center text-center gap-4 max-w-[640px] mx-auto mb-14"
    >
      <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-4">
        <span
          class="font-body text-[12.5px] font-semibold text-muted tracking-[0.02em] inline-block px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-border bg-surface"
          >Cómo trabajamos</span
        >
        <h2 class="font-serif font-medium text-[clamp(28px,3.6vw,42px)] leading-tight">
          Un proceso claro, de punta a punta.
        </h2>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-0 text-muted text-base leading-relaxed">
        Sin sorpresas: sabés qué pasa en cada etapa, desde la primera charla
        hasta el informe de resultados.
      </p>
    </div>
    <ol class="list-none grid grid-cols-4 gap-5 max-md:grid-cols-2 max-sm:grid-cols-1">
      {
        steps.map((s) => (
          <li class="reveal bg-surface border border-border rounded-[14px] px-[22px] py-[26px]">
            <span class="font-serif font-medium text-[26px] block mb-3 text-celeste">{s.n}</span>
            <h4 class="text-[15.5px] font-semibold mb-2">{s.title}</h4>
            <p class="text-muted text-[13.5px] leading-[1.55]">{s.desc}</p>
          </li>
        ))
      }
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>
